---
description: Style conventions for the interview prep notes in docs/
globs: docs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

- Topic pages use: `## Key concepts`, a table or code block, `## Common questions`, then a `!!! warning "Gotchas"` admonition.
- Short English bullets, one idea each; bold the term being defined.
- Tag version-specific facts (for example "Java 21+").
- Never paste raw chat transcripts; keep compact notes only.
- Page title must match its `nav` entry in `mkdocs.yml`.
- Do not commit private data such as salary or offer details.
- Questions go to `docs/question-bank.md` with a short answer and a level: strong, medium or weak.
